# Production build defaults — deliberately EMPTY.
#
# This repository builds one neutral image. Everything deployment-specific
# (API URLs, the OIDC client, error tracking) is supplied at RUNTIME through
# FT_* environment variables on server.ts, served to the SPA as /config.json —
# see src/config/runtime.ts. Baking values in here would hardwire one
# deployment's endpoints into every image built from this source.
#
# A deployment that sets no FT_* at all therefore gets a bundle that points
# nowhere. That is intentional: server.ts refuses to start until the required
# FT_* are present.
